  "correct": "2",
  "solution": "Given equation: 10 * 18 * 19 * 2 * 1 * 217.\n\nBODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\nOption 1) ×, +, ×, +, =\n\nGiven: 10 * 18 * 19 * 2 * 1 * 217\n\nAfter replacing the * signs we get;\n\n⇒ __**10 × 18**__ + __**19 × 2**__ + 1 = 217\n\n⇒ __**180 + 38 + 1**__ = 217\n\n⇒ 219 ≠ 217\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\n**Option 2) ×, +, ×, −, =**\n\nGiven: 10 * 18 * 19 * 2 * 1 * 217\n\nAfter replacing the * signs we get;\n\n⇒ __**10 × 18**__ + __**19 × 2**__ - 1 = 217\n\n⇒ __180 + 38__ - 1 = 217\n\n⇒ __218 – 1__ = 217\n\n**⇒ 217 = 217**\n\n**⇒ LHS = RHS**\n\nOption 3) ×, +, −, −, =\n\nGiven: 10 * 18 * 19 * 2 * 1 * 217\n\nAfter replacing the * signs we get;\n\n⇒ __**10 × 18**__ + 19 - 2 - 1 = 217\n\n⇒ __**180 + 19**__ - 2 - 1 = 217\n\n⇒ 199 __**- 2 - 1**__ = 217\n\n⇒ __**199 - 3**__ = 217\n\n⇒ 196 ≠ 217\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 4) +, +, ×, −, = \n\nGiven: 10 * 18 * 19 * 2 * 1 * 217\n\nAfter replacing the * signs we get;\n\n⇒ 10 + 18 + __**19 × 2**__ - 1 = 217\n\n⇒ __**10 + 18 + **____38__ - 1 = 217\n\n⇒ __66 - 1__ = 217\n\n⇒ 65 ≠ 217\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 2\".",
